{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;The English version was released on May 15.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25bcStory</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Faced with the brink of extinction due to a sudden environmental catastrophe, humanity placed its last hope in a team of android explorers, sent into the depths of space.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aboard one of these vessels, a single android has traveled alone through the cosmos for twenty long years.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At last, it arrives on an uncharted planet\u2014but what awaits it there is unknown...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was localized from Japanese. If you would like to enjoy the game in Japanese, please select Japanese from the settings below.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Library -&gt; Properties -&gt; General -&gt; Language</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay is <strong>choice-based</strong>, but there are <strong>no multiple endings</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are <strong>no restrictions on streaming or content creation</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Estimated playtime:</strong> 60\u201390 minutes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Decision","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3665680/970fa68c1b4d902ff97f3734bcb5f93ed17b1203.jpg"}],"total":1},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3665680?t=1747998312","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3665680?t=1747998312","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665680/f758174717b569dfc0a27669f7e45fe36452e522/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747998312","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665680/f758174717b569dfc0a27669f7e45fe36452e522/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747998312","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;The English version was released on May 15.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25bcStory</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Faced with the brink of extinction due to a sudden environmental catastrophe, humanity placed its last hope in a team of android explorers, sent into the depths of space.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aboard one of these vessels, a single android has traveled alone through the cosmos for twenty long years.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At last, it arrives on an uncharted planet\u2014but what awaits it there is unknown...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was localized from Japanese. If you would like to enjoy the game in Japanese, please select Japanese from the settings below.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Library -&gt; Properties -&gt; General -&gt; Language</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay is <strong>choice-based</strong>, but there are <strong>no multiple endings</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are <strong>no restrictions on streaming or content creation</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Estimated playtime:</strong> 60\u201390 minutes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Neko Plot"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665680/4256a52a402477bcf6a4a1dc7c